@* Full-width bordeaux top navbar — Technical Design Spec.md §3. Replaces the stock left sidebar;
   this is a rewrite, not a retrofit of the old NavMenu (see issue #76's resolution, rule 5).
   Fixed nav order: Schedule · Tracked Movies · Time Preferences · Seat Matrices · Cinemas, with
   Logout pinned right and the brand mark linking Home. Collapse behavior needs Bootstrap's JS
   bundle, wired up in App.razor (issue #76's consequence-found item 6). *@

<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-md">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fw-bold" href="/">
            <i class="bi bi-film" aria-hidden="true"></i> CineScout
        </a>

        <div class="d-flex align-items-center order-md-last gap-2">
            @* A plain HTML form posting to a minimal-API endpoint — the same shape Login.razor
               uses, not Blazor's antiforgery-protected EditForm; ending a session carries none of
               the write-risk that pattern exists to defend (see CLAUDE.md's Login vs. TrackedMovies
               rationale). No AllowAnonymous on /account/logout: the fallback auth policy already
               gates it to signed-in operators. *@
            <form method="post" action="/account/logout" class="d-flex">
                <button type="submit" class="nav-link logout-link d-flex align-items-center gap-1">
                    <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="d-none d-sm-inline">Logout</span>
                </button>
            </form>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navMain" aria-controls="navMain" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navMain">
            <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto" style="gap: 12px;">
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <NavLink class="nav-link d-flex align-items-center gap-1" href="schedule">
                        <i class="bi bi-calendar3" aria-hidden="true"></i> Schedule
                    </NavLink>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <NavLink class="nav-link d-flex align-items-center gap-1" href="tracked-movies">
                        <i class="bi bi-bookmark-star" aria-hidden="true"></i> Tracked Movies
                    </NavLink>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <NavLink class="nav-link d-flex align-items-center gap-1" href="time-preferences">
                        <i class="bi bi-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> Time Preferences
                    </NavLink>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <NavLink class="nav-link d-flex align-items-center gap-1" href="seat-matrices">
                        <i class="bi bi-grid-3x3" aria-hidden="true"></i> Seat Matrices
                    </NavLink>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <NavLink class="nav-link d-flex align-items-center gap-1" href="cinemas">
                        <i class="bi bi-building" aria-hidden="true"></i> Cinemas
                    </NavLink>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>
